OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to store wind farm parts at
OL,4,ASkye's Broadford Aerodrome
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council has proposed opening
OL,7,Fup parts of a small airfield it owns on
OL,8,FSkye for the storage of wind farm
OL,9,Fcomponents.
OL,11,FBroadford Aerodrome, also known as
OL,12,FAshaig Airfield, has a runway and a
OL,13,Fhelipad.
OL,15,FThe airstrip is used by a flying club,
OL,16,Fvisiting aircraft and emergency
OL,17,Fservices but in the past had a service
OL,18,Fto Glasgow - and was a location in the
OL,19,F1980's sci-fi film Flash Gordon.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
