OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to store wind farm parts at
OL,4,ASkye's Broadford Aerodrome
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors will be asked to grant
OL,7,Fplanning consent for two areas for the
OL,8,Fsite to be used as a temporary "lay
OL,9,Fdown" areas for turbine parts until
OL,10,Fthey are needed on wind farms.
